          "title": "So",
          "body": "So\n\n\\[\n(2x-1)+\\frac{x}{3x+1}\n=\\frac{(2x-1)(3x+1)+x}{3x+1}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n=\\frac{6x^2-1}{3x+1}\n\\]"
        }
      ],
      "finalAnswer": "\\(\\dfrac{6x^2-1}{3x+1}\\)."
    },
